<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: armor spike -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.label>穿甲尖刺</UMW_ArmorSpike.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is reinforced into a heavy armor-piercing spike that punches through plate and carapace. -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.description>尖端经过加固，成为沉重的穿甲尖刺，足以击穿板甲与甲壳。</UMW_ArmorSpike.description>

  <!-- EN: lancing -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.0>穿刺</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: armorbane -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.1>破甲</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: punching -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.2>贯穿</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: barbed -->
  <UMW_Barbed.label>倒刺</UMW_Barbed.label>

  <!-- EN: Barbs behind the point catch in the wound and tear it wider as the weapon is drawn back out. -->
  <UMW_Barbed.description>尖端后方的倒刺会钩进伤口，在武器拔出时把伤口撕得更大。</UMW_Barbed.description>

  <!-- EN: barbed -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.0>倒刺</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: hooked -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.1>带钩</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: cruel -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.2>残忍</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: bell-cast -->
  <UMW_BellCast.label>钟铸锤头</UMW_BellCast.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is cast solid like a bell. A clean strike rings through armor and bone, briefly stunning the target. -->
  <UMW_BellCast.description>锤头像钟一样整体铸成。干净利落的一击会震透护甲和骨骼，短暂击晕目标。</UMW_BellCast.description>

  <!-- EN: bell-cast -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.0>钟铸</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: ringing -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.1>鸣响</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: resonant -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.2>共鸣</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: blood-stained -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.label>染血</UMW_BloodStained.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is caked in layers of dark, dried blood. The sight of it can send the people it wounds fleeing in panic. Carrying something so grisly weighs on most people, though a few relish it. Traders will pay less for it. -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.description>该武器上结着一层又一层深色的干涸血块。被它伤到的人一看见就可能惊慌逃窜。大多数人带着如此骇人的东西会感到心情沉重，但也有少数人乐在其中。商人会压价收购。</UMW_BloodStained.description>

  <!-- EN: blood-stained -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.0>染血</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: bloody -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.1>血腥</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: gory -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.2>浴血</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: sanguine -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.3>殷红</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: carbonized -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.label>碳化</UMW_Carbonized.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon has been through fire. Its charred surface is hardened by the heat and will not easily burn again. It hits a little harder than normal, but the scorched body is brittle and wears out faster. -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.description>该武器曾被烈火焚烧。焦黑的表面经高温硬化，不容易再次着火。打击力比普通武器略强，但烧焦的本体较脆，磨损也更快。</UMW_Carbonized.description>

  <!-- EN: carbonized -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.0>碳化</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: fire-blackened -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.1>火燎</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: charred -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.2>焦黑</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: soot-stained -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.3>烟熏</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: counterweighted -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.label>配重</UMW_Counterweighted.label>

  <!-- EN: A counterweight balances the heft, making the weapon quicker to recover between swings at a slight cost to power. -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.description>配重块平衡了武器的重量，使其在两次挥击之间恢复得更快，但威力略有下降。</UMW_Counterweighted.description>

  <!-- EN: balanced -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.0>平衡</UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: swift -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.1>迅捷</UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.1>


  <!-- EN: cumbersome -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.label>笨重</UMW_Cumbersome.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is unwieldy to use, making it slower to swing. -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.description>该武器操作笨重，挥击速度较慢。</UMW_Cumbersome.description>

  <!-- EN: cumbersome -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.0>笨重</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: bulky -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.1>粗大</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: ungainly -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.2>臃肿</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: dead-blow -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.label>无回弹锤头</UMW_DeadBlow.label>

  <!-- EN: The hollow head is filled with loose shot that slams forward on impact, so none of the blow's force bounces back. Targets it strikes will stagger, even when the blow does not drop them. -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.description>中空的锤头内装满松散的弹丸，撞击时弹丸向前涌去，打击的力道毫无回弹。被击中的目标即使没有倒下，也会陷入抑止状态。</UMW_DeadBlow.description>

  <!-- EN: dead-blow -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.0>无回弹</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: shot-filled -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.1>灌珠</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: battering -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.2>冲撞</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: enameled -->
  <UMW_Enameled.label>珐琅釉</UMW_Enameled.label>

  <!-- EN: A vitreous enamel has been fired and fused over the body of this weapon, glazing it in a deep, glossy violet. Traders will pay more for it. -->
  <UMW_Enameled.description>该武器通体烧结了一层玻璃质珐琅釉，呈现出深邃光亮的紫罗兰色。商人会支付更高的价格。</UMW_Enameled.description>

  <!-- EN: enameled -->
  <UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.0>珐琅</UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: glazed -->
  <UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.1>釉彩</UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: violet-sheened -->
  <UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.2>泛紫</UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: envenomed -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.label>淬毒</UMW_Envenomed.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is coated in a slow neurotoxic venom that poisons those it wounds. -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.description>尖端涂有一种缓效的神经毒液，会使被它所伤者中毒。</UMW_Envenomed.description>

  <!-- EN: envenomed -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.0>淬毒</UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: venomous -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.1>蛇毒</UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: poisoned -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.2>有毒</UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: toxic -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.3>剧毒</UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: flanged -->
  <UMW_Flanged.label>棱脊锤头</UMW_Flanged.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is ridged with flanges that concentrate the force of a blow into a narrow edge, cracking armor plate rather than denting it. -->
  <UMW_Flanged.description>锤头上隆起一道道凸缘，将打击的力量集中在狭窄的棱边上，足以击裂装甲板，而不只是砸出凹痕。</UMW_Flanged.description>

  <!-- EN: flanged -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.0>棱脊</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: riving -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.1>劈裂</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: armor-cracking -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.2>裂甲</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: gold inlay -->
  <UMW_GoldInlay.label>黄金镶嵌</UMW_GoldInlay.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is inlaid with gold. Traders will pay more for it. -->
  <UMW_GoldInlay.description>该武器饰以黄金，商人会支付更高的价格。</UMW_GoldInlay.description>

  <!-- EN: gold -->
  <UMW_GoldInlay.traitAdjectives.0>金</UMW_GoldInlay.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: golden -->
  <UMW_GoldInlay.traitAdjectives.1>黄金</UMW_GoldInlay.traitAdjectives.1>


  <!-- EN: head-weighted -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.label>头重</UMW_HeadWeighted.label>

  <!-- EN: The weight is gathered toward the striking end, so each swing lands harder but is slower to recover. -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.description>重量集中在打击端，因此每次挥击都更有力，但挥击后的恢复也更慢。</UMW_HeadWeighted.description>

  <!-- EN: devastating -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.0>毁灭</UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: mighty -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.1>威猛</UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: ponderous -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.2>沉重</UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: jade inlay -->
  <UMW_JadeInlay.label>翡翠镶嵌</UMW_JadeInlay.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is adorned with jade. Traders will pay more for it. -->
  <UMW_JadeInlay.description>该武器饰以翡翠，商人会支付更高的价格。</UMW_JadeInlay.description>

  <!-- EN: jade -->
  <UMW_JadeInlay.traitAdjectives.0>翡翠</UMW_JadeInlay.traitAdjectives.0>


  <!-- EN: lightweight -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.label>轻便</UMW_Lightweight.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is much lighter than normal, quickening its swing. -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.description>该武器比普通型号轻得多，挥击速度更快。</UMW_Lightweight.description>

  <!-- EN: light -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.0>轻</UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: nimble -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.1>灵巧</UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: quickdraw -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.2>迅疾</UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: needle point -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.label>针尖</UMW_NeedlePoint.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is tapered to a fine needle that slips past bone and muscle to reach the organs beneath. Placing it cleanly takes slower, more deliberate thrusts. -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.description>尖端被磨成细针状，可以从骨骼和肌肉之间穿过，刺中下方的器官。想要刺得精准，出刺就要更慢、更谨慎。</UMW_NeedlePoint.description>

  <!-- EN: needle -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.0>针锋</UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: needling -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.1>针刺</UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: hypodermic -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.2>锥心</UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: opiated -->
  <UMW_Opiated.label>阿片涂层</UMW_Opiated.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is coated in a potent opiate that builds in the blood with each hit, eventually rendering the victim unconscious. -->
  <UMW_Opiated.description>尖端涂有强效阿片类药物，每次命中都会使其在血液中积累，最终令受害者失去知觉。</UMW_Opiated.description>

  <!-- EN: opiated -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.0>阿片</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: sedative -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.1>镇静</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: soporific -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.2>催眠</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: numbing -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.3>麻醉</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: ornamental -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.label>华丽</UMW_Ornamental.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon was crafted for aesthetics over functionality. It deals less damage but looks great. -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.description>该武器强调外观而非实用性，伤害较低但造型美观。</UMW_Ornamental.description>

  <!-- EN: beautiful -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.0>美丽</UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: elegant -->
