  <!-- EN: studded -->
  <UMW_Studded.label>嵌钉锤头</UMW_Studded.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is set with hard studs that concentrate the impact, driving extra force into every blow. -->
  <UMW_Studded.description>锤头上嵌满坚硬的凸钉，将冲击集中起来，为每一击注入额外的力道。</UMW_Studded.description>

